{
    "title": "Journie Rewards & SpeedPay",
    "description": "Journie Rewards & SpeedPay gives you the opportunity to earn rewards on all your fuel purchases at participating Mobil\u00ae service stations and gives you a fast, easy and secure way to pay for your fuel from your phone.\r\nJoin JOURNIE Rewards & SpeedPay, get a FREE $10 Mobil\u00ae Digital Gift Card. And that\u2019s just the start!\r\nAs a member of this program, you receive 1 point for every liter of Mobil\u00ae fuels that you purchase. Use those points to pay for future purchases as soon as you earn 100 points!\r\nAdditionally, with Journie Rewards & SpeedPay you don't have to wait in any lines to pay for your fuels. Just open the app, scan the code available at the pump, choose the amount and start fueling your car.\r\nOur system protects your information and transactions because it uses the same high level of encryption used by banks and other highly secure electronic services. Your information will always be safe.\r\nYou can pay with ATH M\u00f3vil, Discover, Visa, MasterCard and American Express credit or debit cards.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Journie Rewards &amp; SpeedPay gives you the opportunity to earn rewards on all your fuel purchases at participating Mobil\u00ae service stations and gives you a fast, easy and secure way to pay for your fuel from your phone.<br>Join JOURNIE Rewards &amp; SpeedPay, get a FREE $10 Mobil\u00ae Digital Gift Card. And that\u2019s just the start!<br>As a member of this program, you receive 1 point for every liter of Mobil\u00ae fuels that you purchase. Use those points to pay for future purchases as soon as you earn 100 points!<br>Additionally, with Journie Rewards &amp; SpeedPay you don&#39;t have to wait in any lines to pay for your fuels. Just open the app, scan the code available at the pump, choose the amount and start fueling your car.<br>Our system protects your information and transactions because it uses the same high level of encryption used by banks and other highly secure electronic services. Your information will always be safe.<br>You can pay with ATH M\u00f3vil, Discover, Visa, MasterCard and American Express credit or debit cards.",
